cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these Hyper-Ramanujan (HR) ellipse circumference or triaxial ellipsoid surface area approximations in your research, software, or AI models, please cite this work as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Oertel"
    given-names: "Sebastian"
    alias: "CodiBasti"
